This repository holds documentation and the manifests that connect AI
assistants to Coredence (gemini-extension.json, plugin.json, mcp.json,
.mcp.json, .claude-plugin/, .agents/). It contains no Coredence source code.

You may install and use these files to connect an assistant to a copy of
Coredence you have installed. Coredence itself, the application these files
start, is licensed under the terms at https://coredence.com/license.
